{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dustless is a side-scrolling action-adventure game set in a wuxia world, featuring a richly layered combat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a sword tomb with no memory\u2014just a sword in hand\u2014and embark on a thorny path filled with hidden conspiracies and deadly encounters. Along the way, you gradually recover fragments of your lost soul and piece together the truth of your identity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Hand-Drawn Art Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a distinctive hand-drawn visual style, crafted in my personal artistic approach and brought to life with high-frame-rate frame-by-frame animation. These meticulously drawn animations lend fluidity and precision to every movement, imbuing the game with a strong sense of vitality and expression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387300/extras/96ada07ad9d2b235e8b4eb8526a5ebc7.poster.avif?t=1770893931\" width=614 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387300/extras/96ada07ad9d2b235e8b4eb8526a5ebc7.webm?t=1770893931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387300/extras/96ada07ad9d2b235e8b4eb8526a5ebc7.mp4?t=1770893931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intricate  Map\u00a0Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an intricately interconnected metroidvania-style world, venturing through unique and atmospheric stages such as Snowfall Pond, Moonseer Pavilion, Heaven's Gate, and the Painted Realm. Each area is filled with secrets, new mechanics, and unlockable paths. As players gain new abilities in later stages, they\u2019ll be able to revisit earlier areas to access previously unreachable zones, deepening both exploration and progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387300/extras/e764d5a314df572239b57a06c25c6944.poster.avif?t=1770893931\" width=614 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387300/extras/e764d5a314df572239b57a06c25c6944.webm?t=1770893931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387300/extras/e764d5a314df572239b57a06c25c6944.mp4?t=1770893931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Satisfying Sword Clashes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on the foundation of classic 2D platforming, the game integrates core wuxia combat elements like parrying, counterattacks, and intense sword duels, encouraging players to face enemies head-on. A range of systems\u2014sword techniques, spiritual artifacts, divine senses, and ultimate skills\u2014intertwine to offer players the freedom to chain together moves and master their own combat style. The fast-paced, rhythmic combat deepens immersion and amplifies the thrill of every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387300/extras/696fb33ee60b97f5a5d7c537bb6ba221.poster.avif?t=1770893931\" width=614 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387300/extras/696fb33ee60b97f5a5d7c537bb6ba221.webm?t=1770893931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387300/extras/696fb33ee60b97f5a5d7c537bb6ba221.mp4?t=1770893931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2387300?t=1770893931","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387300/e6073cef90009113d1eef79045d20a09c81ee0ee/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770893931","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387300/4b950afad43b56c07d70bb6fa087b046c28606d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770893931","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387300/4b950afad43b56c07d70bb6fa087b046c28606d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770893931","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3156480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dustless is a side-scrolling action-adventure game set in a wuxia world, featuring a richly layered combat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a sword tomb with no memory\u2014just a sword in hand\u2014and embark on a thorny path filled with hidden conspiracies and deadly encounters. Along the way, you gradually recover fragments of your lost soul and piece together the truth of your identity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Hand-Drawn Art Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a distinctive hand-drawn visual style, crafted in my personal artistic approach and brought to life with high-frame-rate frame-by-frame animation. These meticulously drawn animations lend fluidity and precision to every movement, imbuing the game with a strong sense of vitality and expression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387300/extras/96ada07ad9d2b235e8b4eb8526a5ebc7.poster.avif?t=1770893931\" width=614 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akam